      "id": "function:yosoi::locators::LocateResult::try_new",
      "publicPath": "yosoi::locators::LocateResult::try_new",
      "title": "yosoi::locators::LocateResult::try_new",
      "kind": "function",
      "signature": "pub fn try_new(document_id: yosoi::DocumentId, findings: Vec<yosoi::locators::Finding>) -> Result<Self, LocateResultError>",
      "docs": "Creates a result and derives its unique region set from finding lineage.\n\nOwns the supplied findings and checks that they are nonempty, belong to\n`document_id`, and have strictly increasing order. Returns\n[`LocateResultError`] for invalid structure. Use\n[`Self::try_new_with_regions`] to retain matched regions with no findings.",
